Z||000003||rogergarrison||12-13-2001||05:45 AM||||Rear C-V joint. They could have damaged it during removal for the clutch replacement. It expands slightly when it gets hot after a few minutes of driving and stops rattleing. <p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 12-13-2001).]||||reg||1
